    "causal_summary": "The deep-alignment packet contains 15 underscore-bearing directory families and 68 underscore-bearing files across adapters, catalogs, playbooks, and state references. This phase renames those in-scope paths to kebab-case and repairs path-valued resource maps while preserving authority identifiers, embedded code keys, read-only behavior, and tool-mandated names.",
